WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0126: WoW's ground shade of BG3's figures, for BG3's own lighting (on top of 0001-0125).

- link/wowshade.txt: "WSH1 <count>", then a line a figure "<x y z, WoW yards> <0 lit .. 1 shadowed>": the light
  ramp of the roots "wowbg3 Tav" and "wowbg3 companion N" (entity_shade.rs: the baked shadow of the ground under a
  unit, the WMO and interior rules, the reference's ramp), written whole when a figure moved 0.3 yd or its level
  0.02. BG3 draws those figures itself; the render plugin shadows each one in BG3's sun by this level.
- GroundShade::shadowed(): the ramp between the lit outdoor level and the shadowed one, 0 to 1.
- While BG3 draws the party (pose flag 8, patch 0122) the hidden roots are still moved to where the figures stand:
  left where WoW last drew them (the world's origin on a start that never did), their shade was that place's.

